 Azure DevOps Engineer Interview Questions (1–3 Years Experience)

If you’re preparing for an interview, these questions are commonly asked in real interviews and help you brush up on fundamentals + scenarios.

Focus Areas:

🔹 Azure DevOps Pipelines
🔹 CI/CD concepts
🔹 Repos / Git branching
🔹 Terraform / ARM
🔹 YAML
🔹 Containers & Kubernetes
🔹 Monitoring & Security

Here are some top questions you MUST prepare 👇


Top Interview Questions
What are the main components of Azure DevOps?
How do you create a CI/CD pipeline in Azure DevOps?
What is the difference between a build pipeline and release pipeline?
Explain YAML pipelines vs Classic pipelines.
How do you use Azure Repos?
Why do we use Service Connections in pipelines?
What is an Agent Pool?
How do Hosted agents differ from Self-Hosted agents?
What is a Stage, Job, and Task in YAML?
How do you implement approvals in release pipeline?

⚙️ Infrastructure & Deployment Questions
How do you deploy an application to Azure App Service using pipeline?
Have you used Terraform or ARM templates? Explain.
How do you store secrets in Azure DevOps?
What is Azure Key Vault? How to integrate with pipelines?
How do you manage environment variables across Dev, QA, Prod?

🐳 Container & Kubernetes
How do you build and push Docker images in pipeline?
How do you deploy to AKS using Azure DevOps?
What is Helm and why do we use it?
What are readiness and liveness probes in Kubernetes?
How do you roll back a deployment in AKS?

📊 Monitoring & Logging
What is Azure Monitor?
What is Application Insights?
How do you troubleshoot a failed pipeline?
How do you collect logs from Kubernetes and view them?

🛡️ Security & Best Practices
How do you enable RBAC in Azure DevOps?
What is Policy in Repos?
Why code review is important?
How do you secure secrets in pipeline?
Explain Zero Downtime Deployment.
What are Blue-Green & Canary deployments?
